// the module's public surface, built out of the internal half beside it. `grown` is reachable here because
// this file is in the same module; `scale` is not, and this file does not try
//
// `public` is the one modifier in this library that does any work - it is what makes the name crossable
public function offered(int32 $v) : int32
{
    return grown($v);
}
